# B2 (window slide), as the checker shrank it on 0.2.8: the cold return cannot summarise (the 60K turn is protected), the
# window slides at the next prompt 60 s later and the warm run plan summarises (NR fails at req 1, witnessed by req 2)
world explicit known ttl=300 true=300 survival=none c=1 sys=3000 window=200000 native interactive
